I filed a Petition for Review of Denial of Public Records Request in this m=
atter on July 22, 2026, and a first supplemental on July 24, 2026. I write =
to supplement the record a second time.</div>
<div class=3D"elementToProof" style=3D"font-family: Aptos, &quot;Aptos_Embe=
ddedFont&quot;, &quot;Aptos_MSFontService&quot;, Calibri, Helvetica, sans-s=
