ddedFont&quot;, &quot;Aptos_MSFontService&quot;, Calibri, Helvetica, sans-s=
erif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">
On July 27, 2026, five days after the petition was filed, Oregon State Poli=
ce notified me that a thorough review has identified additional responsive =
records and that it is reopening PR27478, with production estimated at thre=
e weeks. I do not withdraw the petition.
 The Department's notice resolves none of its counts =97 it describes no se=
arch, cites no exemption, rules on no fee waiver, and does not say whether =
the recorded dispatch communications for March 24, 2026 still exist.</div>
<div class=3D"elementToProof" style=3D"font-family: Aptos, &quot;Aptos_Embe=
ddedFont&quot;, &quot;Aptos_MSFontService&quot;, Calibri, Helvetica, sans-s=
erif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">
<br>
</div>
<div class=3D"elementToProof" style=3D"font-family: Aptos, &quot;Aptos_Embe=
ddedFont&quot;, &quot;Aptos_MSFontService&quot;, Calibri, Helvetica, sans-s=
erif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">
The attached supplemental filing places the Department's own admission in t=
he record; identifies the one assertion in it that cannot be correct as wri=
tten (that records of a March 24 event were &quot;not in our system&quot; o=
n April 3); and renews, with urgency, the
 single time-sensitive request in this matter =97 whether the March 24 disp=
atch recordings still exist and whether any responsive record has been dest=
royed, purged, or allowed to age off a retention schedule since April 2, 20=
26. That question can be answered
 in a sentence and does not depend on the three-week review now underway.</=
div>
<div class=3D"elementToProof" style=3D"font-family: Aptos, &quot;Aptos_Embe=
ddedFont&quot;, &quot;Aptos_MSFontService&quot;, Calibri, Helvetica, sans-s=
erif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">
<br>
</div>
<div class=3D"elementToProof" style=3D"font-family: Aptos, &quot;Aptos_Embe=
ddedFont&quot;, &quot;Aptos_MSFontService&quot;, Calibri, Helvetica, sans-s=
erif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">
The filing is attached, together with the newly added exhibits: Exhibit 27 =
(the Department's reopening notice) and Exhibit 28 (my response of July 27,=
 2026). Exhibit 26 (the July 24, 2026 letter from the District Ranger) was =
filed with the first supplemental
 and is included in the attached package for reference.</div>
